=== Post Kawaei Shogunate era ===
Following the [[Kuji Restoration]] in 18 May 1803, Kuji abolished the effective separation between imperial court and shogunate administration, centralized authority, weakened daimyo autonomy, and established the foundations of the modern [[Nakamizu Empire]]. While Kawaei Shoguns still exist as the head of government, it is slowly losing its authority over time until its total abolition in 1903.
